"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, I mean, I ⟪k:2⟫did⟪k:3⟫ make up a good half of it,⟪k:4⟫but the maid really did "
"hear a sound in the middle of the night."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫嘛。⟪k:2⟫确实，⟪k:3⟫一半的原因是为了讲我编的鬼故事。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫不过啊，⟪k:6⟫真的有女仆晚"
"上听到过奇怪的声音。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_79A15F8D_75C8_486C_94EA_123192FF01A3
