#: scenario3:scenario3_420D736B_63E1_46ED_B0B1_C92E330BE4DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f961a5ef7437f969f5a5216b814d0f52405cd2c01083499ce65d9134f2e58fd0
