msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫混杂了各个时代的痕迹……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC18B130_44EE_431A_88F6_029BB85BA802
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 268f545efe6693f53f8167f588e47f02f02ef67cd18bc8d0e1ce1ef5e210c244
